{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1432394-what-happens-if-you-are-an-outsider-in-a-splinter-and-it-resets","id":1432394,"title":"What happens if you are an outsider in a splinter and it resets?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-01-16T03:36:37-08:00","id":1432394,"title":"What happens if you are an outsider in a splinter and it resets?","content":"There's another splinter related question thread but I don't remember the etiquette on responding to threads that have been dead for awhile.<br /> Anyway do you get sent to the beginning and your memories purged or what? Also I noticed that Y2k suggests you can't enter a splinter you're currently alive in.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-17T14:44:06-08:00","id":1432545,"title":"","content":"Not entirely sure, myself, but I think you just get sent back to the portal you entered from, albeit on the side inside the splinter(?). I advise checking the D:TD Books, or conversing with a suitable staff member such as <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1094-eric-zawadzki\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1094\" data-vbnamecard=\"1094\">Eric Zawadzki</a> over the details.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":25791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","user":"TerrorCooper","date":". 01-19-2021, 08:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T17:31:13-08:00","id":1529477,"title":"","content":"Has an answer been given? I\u2019m curious myself.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28143-firestar001","name":"firestar001","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"45"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-25T18:14:57-08:00","id":1529479,"title":"","content":"Demons are explicitly immune to the memory-resetting effects of the splinter, as are stigmatics made from the locals (who are gradually phased out across the next four resets), but otherwise the text states that everyone within the splinter at the end of its calendar is reset with no memory; no further detail is provided, so it's down to individual tables if that means visitors are kicked out, naturalized into the moment, or simply show up at the point in the loop where they entered with no memory of anything they learned in the last go-around.<br /> <br /> I am reasonably certain the demon and angel versions of Y2K cannot cross into or out of the 1999 splinter because of what they are and how they relate to the events of the splinter rather than out of any sort of generalizeable quality of splinters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-29T09:21:29-08:00","id":1529647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Deinos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1432394-what-happens-if-you-are-an-outsider-in-a-splinter-and-it-resets#post1432394\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's another splinter related question thread but I don't remember the etiquette on responding to threads that have been dead for awhile.<br /> Anyway do you get sent to the beginning and your memories purged or what? Also I noticed that Y2k suggests you can't enter a splinter you're currently alive in.</div> </div> </div> </div>I started a very old thread about a <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/926229-splinter-and-stigmatic-questions\">similar set of questions</a>, it might be helpful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https: